### Get Metrics Volume
# WIP: the handler does not return anything yet, it only has a test fmt.Println.
# It responds 200 with an empty body until the real logic is implemented.
# Idea: it should return volume metrics of processed events
# (see internal/processor/worker for where that data is generated).
# Path params:
#   apiKeyId  API key whose metrics are requested
# NOTE: the route is registered as /v1/api/metrics/volume/:apiKeyId, so this
#       request (without the param) currently gets a 404.
# See: cmd/api/metrics.go getMetricsVolumeHandler
# @name metricsVolume
GET {{host}}/v1/api/metrics/volume
